{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-677f373658d2","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-677f373658d2","name":"砂糖椰子冰沙","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E7%A0%82%E7%B3%96%E6%A4%B0%E5%AD%90%E5%86%B0%E6%B2%99/%E7%A0%82%E7%B3%96%E6%A4%B0%E5%AD%90%E5%86%B0%E6%B2%99.md","blob_sha":"276a30e5ecd6f65720c5fac329f8f97653fede63","details":{"introduction":"砂糖椰子冰沙是一道极具热带风情的快手冷饮，清甜的椰香融合粗粒黄糖的焦香，口感绵密冰爽。椰子水富含天然电解质与矿物质，能快速补充水分，咖啡调糖增添碳水能量。制作门槛极低，只要提前将椰汁冻硬，敲打成沙即可，对新手毫无压力。从冷冻到出品需提前准备 10 小时以上，但动手操作仅需几分钟，很适合作为悠闲的午后冰品。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 瓶装椰汁（瓶口较大为佳）\n- 咖啡调糖（黄色粗粒）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"冰沙最佳份量通常与融化速度有关，300g 在零下 18 度制成的冰沙在室温下通常可维持 30 分钟。\n\n每份：\n\n- 瓶装椰子汁 500ml\n- 咖啡调糖 10g（两包太古咖啡调糖）\n- 坚果碎（可选）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 500ml 瓶装椰汁倒掉 200ml，立刻拧紧瓶盖。\n2. 将这瓶椰汁放入冰箱冷冻区并冷冻 10 小时以上。\n3. 将这瓶椰汁取出，若确认瓶中椰汁已彻底冻结，则在墙角、椅背、桌角等坚硬表面上用力抽打。（请务必确认表面不会因此受到损伤）\n4. 当抽打到冻结椰汁变成冰沙状态，打开瓶盖倒出冰沙。\n5. 在冰沙表面均匀撒上咖啡调糖或坚果碎。\n6. 完成"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 在以上步骤中，瓶装椰汁可以提前冰冻，但是不宜超过 7 天，否则有变质风险。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：椰子水350g、椰奶100g、白砂糖40g、饮用水60g；整份约550g。无酒精版，不含商业品牌糖浆，冰计入水重。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":82.054545,"protein_g":0.874545,"carbohydrate_g":10.640909,"fat_g":4.454545},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170174/nutrients","version":"f266d18f5bce5dbb","fdc_ids":[170174,170172,169655,173647]},"profile_id":"family-677f373658d2-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-677f373658d2","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-677f373658d2","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-677f373658d2-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"coconut_water","grams":350},{"key":"coconut_milk","grams":100},{"key":"sugar","grams":40},{"key":"water","grams":60}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"f266d18f5bce5dbb","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-677f373658d2-v1.460afa2e307d2e51.json","bytes":20343,"sha256":"460afa2e307d2e51cf34430d0716794473662480cf70f9c0a967c0c32221b2a6"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-677f373658d2-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-677f373658d2","recipe_blob_sha":"276a30e5ecd6f65720c5fac329f8f97653fede63","version":"1","data_version":"f266d18f5bce5dbb","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：椰子水350g、椰奶100g、白砂糖40g、饮用水60g；整份约550g。无酒精版，不含商业品牌糖浆，冰计入水重。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-677f373658d2","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-677f373658d2-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"coconut_water","grams":350},{"key":"coconut_milk","grams":100},{"key":"sugar","grams":40},{"key":"water","grams":60}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":82.054545,"protein_g":0.874545,"carbohydrate_g":10.640909,"fat_g":4.454545},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170174/nutrients","version":"f266d18f5bce5dbb","fdc_ids":[170174,170172,169655,173647]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"